@startuml
title BMS - Component Diagram
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Presentation Layer" {
  [Web UI (DS-UI)] as UI
}
package "API Layer" {
  [REST Controllers] as API
  [Security Layer (DS-SEC)\nTLS, validation, masking, rate limiting] as SEC
}
package "Service Layer" {
  [Auth Service (DS-AUTH)] as AUTH
  [Account Service (DS-ACC)] as ACC
  [Transaction Service (DS-TXN)] as TXN
  [Admin and Reporting Service (DS-ADM)] as ADM
  [Audit and Notification Service (DS-AUD)] as AUD
}
package "Data Layer" {
  [Data Access Layer (DS-DB)] as DAL
  database "BMS Database" as DB
}

UI --> API : HTTPS / JSON
API ..> SEC : uses
API --> AUTH
API --> ACC
API --> TXN
API --> ADM
AUTH --> DAL
ACC --> DAL
TXN --> DAL
ADM --> DAL
AUD --> DAL
AUTH ..> AUD : audit events
ACC ..> AUD : audit events
TXN ..> AUD : audit + notifications
ADM ..> AUD : audit events
DAL --> DB
@enduml